.TH SIM-APN 8 "2026-11-16" "vibeos 0.1.0" "VibeOS"
.SH NAME
sim-apn \- mobile data profile for every new SIM
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sim-apn
.SH DESCRIPTION
Watches ModemManager for SIMs that no NetworkManager connection applies to and adds one for each: named after the operator, with the APN from mobile-broadband-provider-info, pinned to that SIM (gsm.sim-id), autoconnecting, with roaming off. A connection made by hand, and a SIM that already has one, are left alone. It runs as sim-apn.service.
.SH SEE ALSO
ModemManager(8), NetworkManager(8)
